@startuml
!include skin.iuml
hide empty description
[*] --> Loading : generate command
Loading --> Failed : file unreadable
Loading --> Validating : requirements read
state Validating {
  [*] --> CheckingRequirements
  CheckingRequirements --> Normalizing : free text found\n[LLM enabled]
  Normalizing --> CheckingRequirements : normalization finished
  CheckingRequirements --> [*] : all checked
}
Validating --> Failed : no valid requirement
Validating --> Generating : at least one valid requirement
Generating --> Previewing : features built
Previewing --> Finished : [preview only]
Previewing --> Exporting : export confirmed
Exporting --> WaitingForConfirmation : file already exists
WaitingForConfirmation --> Exporting : answer given
Exporting --> Finished : all files processed
Finished --> [*]
Failed --> [*]
@enduml
